---
// Dropping a database column while old app processes are still running:
// one release (old code meets a missing column) versus GitLab's three-release rule.
// Plain inline SVG with site tokens and no ids, so the figure can render more than once.

const W = 900;
const H = 470;
const x0 = 170;
const x1 = 880;

// Top: everything in one release.
const dropAt = 470; // migration drops the column
const oldUntil = 680; // last old process restarted
const laneApp = 92;
const laneDb = 150;
const laneH = 40;

// Bottom: three releases.
const relY = 270;
const relW = (x1 - x0 - 2 * 12) / 3;
const rel = [0, 1, 2].map((i) => x0 + i * (relW + 12));
const bApp = 318;
const bDb = 372;
const bH = 42;
const releases = [
  {
    name: 'M',
    appEn: 'code ignores the column', appVi: 'code bỏ qua cột này',
    dbEn: 'column still in the table', dbVi: 'cột vẫn còn trong bảng',
  },
  {
    name: 'M+1',
    appEn: 'code still ignores it', appVi: 'code vẫn bỏ qua cột',
    dbEn: 'post-deploy migration drops it', dbVi: 'migration sau deploy xoá cột',
  },
  {
    name: 'M+2',
    appEn: 'ignore rule removed', appVi: 'gỡ luật bỏ qua',
    dbEn: 'column gone', dbVi: 'cột đã mất',
  },
];
---
<figure class="scr">
  <div class="scr-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two ways to drop a database column. Top: in one release, the migration drops the column while old application processes, which cached the table schema at boot, are still running, so their queries fail until they are restarted. Bottom: GitLab's rule spreads it over three releases: first the code ignores the column, then a post-deployment migration drops it, then the ignore rule is removed, so running code always agrees with the table.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="scr-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Drop the column in the same release</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Xoá cột ngay trong cùng một bản release</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x={x0 - 14} y={laneApp + 25} text-anchor="end" class="scr-lane">
      <tspan data-lang-en>app processes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>các process app</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x0 - 14} y={laneDb + 25} text-anchor="end" class="scr-lane">
      <tspan data-lang-en>database</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>database</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={x0} y={laneApp} width={oldUntil - x0} height={laneH} rx="4" class="scr-box" />
    <text x={x0 + 12} y={laneApp + 25} class="scr-in">
      <tspan data-lang-en>old code, schema cached at boot</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>code cũ, schema đã cache lúc khởi động</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={oldUntil} y={laneApp} width={x1 - oldUntil} height={laneH} rx="4" class="scr-box is-new" />
    <text x={oldUntil + 12} y={laneApp + 25} class="scr-in">
      <tspan data-lang-en>new code</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>code mới</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={x0} y={laneDb} width={dropAt - x0} height={laneH} rx="4" class="scr-box" />
    <text x={x0 + 12} y={laneDb + 25} class="scr-in">
      <tspan data-lang-en>column exists</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cột còn tồn tại</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x={dropAt} y={laneDb} width={x1 - dropAt} height={laneH} rx="4" class="scr-box is-gone" />
    <text x={oldUntil + 12} y={laneDb + 25} class="scr-in">
      <tspan data-lang-en>column dropped</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cột đã bị xoá</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={dropAt} y={laneApp - 6} width={oldUntil - dropAt} height={laneDb + laneH - laneApp + 12} class="scr-danger" />
    <line x1={dropAt} x2={dropAt} y1={laneApp - 26} y2={laneDb + laneH + 6} class="scr-mark" />
    <text x={dropAt + 6} y={laneApp - 12} class="scr-note is-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>migration runs</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>migration chạy</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={(dropAt + oldUntil) / 2} y={laneDb + laneH + 26} text-anchor="middle" class="scr-note is-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>old processes query a column that is gone: errors until restarted</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>process cũ truy vấn một cột không còn: lỗi cho tới khi restart</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="236" y2="236" class="scr-divider" />

    <text x="20" y={relY - 8} class="scr-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Spread it over three releases (GitLab's rule)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chia ra ba bản release (quy tắc của GitLab)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x0 - 14} y={bApp + 26} text-anchor="end" class="scr-lane">
      <tspan data-lang-en>app code</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>code app</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x0 - 14} y={bDb + 26} text-anchor="end" class="scr-lane">
      <tspan data-lang-en>database</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>database</tspan>
    </text>

    {releases.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x={rel[i] + relW / 2} y={bApp - 14} text-anchor="middle" class="scr-rel">
          <tspan data-lang-en>release {r.name}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>bản {r.name}</tspan>
        </text>
        <rect x={rel[i]} y={bApp} width={relW} height={bH} rx="4" class={i === 2 ? 'scr-box is-new' : 'scr-box'} />
        <text x={rel[i] + 12} y={bApp + 26} class="scr-in">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{r.appEn}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.appVi}</tspan>
        </text>
        <rect x={rel[i]} y={bDb} width={relW} height={bH} rx="4" class={i === 0 ? 'scr-box' : 'scr-box is-gone'} />
        <text x={rel[i] + 12} y={bDb + 26} class="scr-in">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{r.dbEn}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.dbVi}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={x0} y={bDb + bH + 30} class="scr-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>At every moment, every running process agrees with the table it reads.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ở mọi thời điểm, mọi process đang chạy đều khớp với cái bảng nó đọc.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Why GitLab drops a column in three releases. Rails' ActiveRecord caches each table's columns when a process boots, so a process started before the migration still expects the column. The release names M, M+1 and M+2 are GitLab's.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì sao GitLab xoá một cột qua ba bản release. ActiveRecord của Rails cache danh sách cột của từng bảng khi process khởi động, nên process chạy từ trước migration vẫn tin là cột còn đó. Tên M, M+1 và M+2 là của GitLab.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .scr {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .scr-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .scr svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .scr text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
  }
  .scr .scr-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .scr .scr-lane {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .scr .scr-rel {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .scr .scr-in {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .scr .scr-note {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .scr .scr-note.is-red {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .scr-box {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .scr-box.is-new {
    fill: var(--card-bg);
    stroke: var(--text);
  }
  .scr-box.is-gone {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  .scr-danger {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    fill-opacity: 0.55;
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .scr-mark {
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .scr-divider {
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }
  .scr figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
